#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:1 c9325b60d4e9403ea0343461ae022fb3
msgid "可视化"
msgstr "Visualization"

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:3 dd8c502def454afeba68710e199e4b6f
msgid "画布是右侧的 Three.js 3D 视图（会合系，质心归一化坐标），展示计算结果与 轨道库轨迹。"
msgstr "The canvas is the Three.js 3D view on the right (synodic frame, barycentric normalized coordinates), showing computation results and catalog trajectories."

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:6 9bc32f9251aa41888ae517b268c80741
msgid "双层模型"
msgstr "Two-Layer Model"

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:8 1cbdf678c94e48e5ae2aebda9f22b3cb
msgid "画布内容分两层（CONTEXT.md 领域语义）："
msgstr "Canvas content is split into two layers (CONTEXT.md domain semantics):"

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:10 ceaca659f6504bf8ad7e85e9b5c312b5
msgid "**结果层**：最近一次计算或查看的产物，新内容到达时整体替换；"
msgstr "**Result layer**: the product of the latest computation or view, replaced wholesale when new content arrives;"

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:11 4a24a357ac0341aabca9e124a6fef156
msgid "**固定层**：从项目树钉住（图钉）的库记录，持续与结果层同屏显示，直到 手动取消；软上限 5 条，超出提示但不拦截。"
msgstr "**Pinned layer**: catalog records pinned (pushpin) from the project tree, kept on screen alongside the result layer until unpinned; soft-capped at 5 entries — exceeding it warns but does not block."

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:14 262a5b67d2ad4516aa96d0a62a56791b
msgid "固定层轨迹经 `catalog_get` 懒加载取成员数据；两层共用时间轴与取景。"
msgstr "Pinned-layer trajectories load member data lazily via `catalog_get`; both layers share the timeline and framing."

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:16 acc9a0c7c6aa495689f1bc05c979fd4c
msgid "交互"
msgstr "Interaction"

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:18 10d640ebc8e64d799b8134bed796390f
msgid "**左键拖拽**：旋转视角；**滚轮**：缩放；**右键拖拽**：平移。"
msgstr "**Left-drag**: rotate; **wheel**: zoom; **right-drag**: pan."

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:19 780f110a5c50425ab867dbfa01ecfad6
msgid "**适配**（画布工具栏）：按当前轨迹的包围盒重设相机，按包围盒对角线长度留 5% 余量。"
msgstr "**Fit** (canvas toolbar): recentres the camera on the current trajectories' bounding box, with a 5% margin on the box diagonal."

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:20 10f2e3bbfa504464a3559a4baba9edd8
msgid "**视图保持**：首次数据到达时自动适配一次；此后增删轨迹不重置相机， 手动旋转缩放的视角不被打扰（CONTEXT.md 领域语义）。"
msgstr ""
"**View preservation**: the view auto-fits once when data first arrives; "
"afterwards adding or removing trajectories does not reset the camera, so "
"your manual rotate/zoom is never disturbed (domain semantics in "
"CONTEXT.md)."

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:22 fcf605ec18f046d889f23f2f227ddc19
msgid ""
"**投影与中心**（画布工具栏）：投影在 3D 与 XY / XZ / YZ 三视图间切换； 中心在地月质心、地心、月心与 L1 / L2 "
"平动点间切换。"
msgstr "**Projection and center** (canvas toolbar): projection switches between 3D and the XY / XZ / YZ views; the center switches between the Earth–Moon barycentre, Earth, Moon, and the L1 / L2 libration points."

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:25 769fa6fadc1f49b5bef0642143bb9862
msgid "时间轴"
msgstr "Timeline"

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:27 012a54f91df342ea86b2b9a9bc16e9b9
msgid ""
"画布下方的时间轴在有时刻数据时可用：拖动滑杆或点播放，画布上的时刻 标记沿轨迹插值移动，读数以自起点的偏移天数（T + N 天）表示。时刻来源： "
"周期轨道按周期均匀合成；星历类结果用响应自带的 epochs；无时刻信息的 点集时间轴保持禁用。轨迹位置按「et 秒 / 历元 "
"UTC」两级时刻基准解析， 物理单位（km）数据如实入画不换算。"
msgstr "The timeline below the canvas is enabled when time data exists: drag the slider or press play, and the canvas time marker interpolates along trajectories, read out as offset days from the start (T + N days). Time sources: periodic orbits are synthesized uniformly by period; ephemeris-type results use the epochs carried by the response; point sets without time information keep the timeline honestly disabled. Trajectory positions are resolved on the two-level time basis (\"et seconds / epoch UTC\"), and physical-unit (km) data is drawn as-is without conversion."

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:33 76cac9f9529944b18e37b88aa83b4303
msgid "转移设计结果在时间轴上标注机动事件：出发/到达脉冲以 chip 显示 （带 Δv 数值），点击 chip 跳到对应时刻。"
msgstr "Transfer-design results mark maneuver events on the timeline: departure/arrival pulses appear as chips (with Δv values); clicking a chip jumps to that moment."

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:36 2d9c47fe243e42d793073263990ded58
msgid "天体、标注与配色"
msgstr "Bodies, Annotations and Colors"

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:38 020fee18d3f9434c85bd0aa01d0c7a8a
msgid ""
"**天体**：地球与月球使用 NASA 公有领域贴图（Blue Marble / LROC）， 半径取真实比例，Phong "
"光照产生晨昏线，夜面留环境光可辨； 天体大小可在图表设置调整。"
msgstr "**Bodies**: Earth and Moon use NASA public-domain textures (Blue Marble / LROC) at true radius ratio; Phong lighting produces a day/night terminator, with ambient light keeping the night side visible. Body sizes are adjustable in chart settings."

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:41 f7065a3236e14890aa903d3b06d0a958
msgid "**平动点**：L1 / L2 以球体与文字标注固定绘制。"
msgstr "**Libration points**: L1 / L2 are drawn as fixed spheres with text labels."

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:42 5267a7a1a13b47cf8bdfa9947281f056
msgid ""
"**Jacobi 着色**：携带 Jacobi 常数的轨迹按当前画布内取值范围归一后以 coolwarm "
"色带着色，画布角显示颜色条与数值范围；无值轨迹回退颜色循环 （seaborn muted 低饱和配色）。"
msgstr "**Jacobi coloring**: trajectories carrying a Jacobi constant are colored on the coolwarm ramp, normalized to the value range currently on canvas, with a color bar and range shown in the corner; trajectories without a value fall back to the color cycle (seaborn muted, low saturation)."

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:45 d18d248f55574f2fa658dcc174b750a2
msgid ""
"**图例**：固定层记录与命名轨迹进图例，色样如实反映线的实际颜色；每条 图例项附**数据系**标注（会合系无量纲 / 会合系物理 km / "
"地心惯性 km）， 标明数据固有的坐标系——与用户显示选择的视图系（投影/中心切换）是两回事。"
msgstr "**Legend**: pinned-layer records and named trajectories enter the legend with swatches that faithfully mirror the actual line colors; each entry carries a **data-frame** annotation (synodic nondimensional / synodic physical km / geocentric-inertial km) stating the frame inherent to the data — a different thing from the view frame the user chooses (projection/center switching)."

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:49 8adf4e9dd6ba40b59c41c5c1a415a5d8
msgid "参照图层"
msgstr "Reference Layers"

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:51 f180996e55e848638cd8be92691c3cfa
msgid "两组可开关的参照几何（图表设置控制，均不参与取景适配）："
msgstr "Two toggleable sets of reference geometry (controlled in chart settings; neither participates in view fitting):"

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:53 ef2773d80ac04707bc59e0a562083524
msgid ""
"**坐标轴与网格**（matplotlib 式参照系）：XYZ 三轴箭头与轴名标注，轨道面 网格带 0.5 DU "
"刻度数字；量程（网格半宽）0.5–3.0 DU 可调。"
msgstr "**Axes and grid** (a matplotlib-style reference frame): XYZ arrows with axis labels, and an orbital-plane grid with 0.5 DU tick numbers; the range (grid half-width) is adjustable from 0.5 to 3.0 DU."

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:55 bbcd0ec0389647f6b37342e77abd1304
msgid ""
"**地月空间分区图层**：e2m2e `spatiography_boundaries` 工具（Rosengren et al. 2026 "
"Primer §5 五省分区）返回的边界几何——地心 Laplace 半径、 地球/月球 SOI 与 Hill 圆族、Battin "
"非对称闭合曲线、Chebotarev 圆与 L3–L5 平动点标记，经 km→DU 归一后作为固定参照层显示。边界几何全部由 e2m2e "
"离散化给出，界面只做单位归一。"
msgstr "**Cislunar partition layer**: boundary geometry returned by the e2m2e `spatiography_boundaries` tool (Rosengren et al. 2026 Primer §5 five-province partition) — the geocentric Laplace radius, Earth/Moon SOI and Hill circle families, the Battin asymmetric closed curves, Chebotarev circles and L3–L5 libration-point markers — normalized from km to DU and displayed as a fixed reference layer. All boundary geometry is discretized by e2m2e; the UI only normalizes units."

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:61 c1e96239b690481eb4503911222ea92b
msgid "图表设置"
msgstr "Chart Settings"

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:63 6e2a5bca5a994e59b8576c8d776feff5
msgid "画布工具栏的图表设置打开设置面板，即时生效并持久化（localStorage），可一键 恢复默认："
msgstr "Chart Settings in the canvas toolbar opens the settings panel — changes apply instantly and persist (localStorage), with one-click reset to defaults:"

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:66 2f00c8b14ebc4e2a8215e364d5f18016
msgid "轨道线宽与颜色循环；"
msgstr "Orbit line width and color cycle;"

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:67 6ef03298d60846f588b07a9b81afc58e
msgid "地球 / 月球 / 平动点标注大小、平动点颜色、标注字号；"
msgstr "Earth / Moon / libration-point marker sizes, libration-point color, label font size;"

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:68 db1e29059e874310b902813a1e3be321
msgid "Z 轴比例（近平面轨道防压扁）；"
msgstr "Z-axis ratio (prevents squashing near-planar orbits);"

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:69 079617d2b1194458b71929358d56e307
msgid "坐标轴与分区图层开关、网格量程；"
msgstr "Axes and partition-layer toggles, grid range;"

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:70 c9d118daab7449e1844a31e15725c937
msgid "画布背景色（跟随主题 / 白 / 深灰 / 黑），网格与标注颜色随背景亮度自适应。"
msgstr "Canvas background (follow theme / white / dark gray / black), with grid and label colors adapting to background brightness."

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:72 72f5efeb277a4135b531c727b4de4ede
msgid "导出动画"
msgstr "Export Animation"

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:74 51c3a84e308649c78184df78b2ee36da
msgid ""
"画布工具栏的导出动画录制 8 秒画布自转（30 fps），经浏览器 MediaRecorder 编码 为 `orbit-"
"animation.webm` 下载；不依赖外部编码器。录制期间按钮显示进度态， 结束后自动停止自转。"
msgstr "Export Animation in the canvas toolbar records 8 seconds of canvas auto-rotation (30 fps), encoded by the browser's MediaRecorder into `orbit-animation.webm` for download — no external encoder needed. The button shows progress while recording; rotation stops automatically at the end."

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:78 596483021adc442db4e0f286bddcc35a
msgid "视觉语言"
msgstr "Visual Language"

#: ../../source/guide/visualization.md:80 f086888a019a45219ae5cc6efed18e16
msgid ""
"界面遵循严肃语义色板（ADR 0020）：全局 2px "
"直角；用色限定黑/白/灰/红/蓝/绿/橙七种色相——红=错误、绿=成功、橙=警告、蓝=主色/信息，中性色沿用 antd "
"灰阶，主色为收敛深蓝。画布内轨迹配色仍按上文规则自动分配（Jacobi 着色优先，颜色循环兜底）。"
msgstr "The interface follows the serious semantic palette (ADR 0020): 2px corners throughout; hue usage is limited to black/white/gray/red/blue/green/orange — red = error, green = success, orange = warning, blue = primary/info — with neutrals on the antd gray scale and a restrained deep-blue primary. Canvas trajectory colors are still assigned automatically per the rules above (Jacobi coloring first, color cycle as fallback)."

